        "original_id": "274a85a1-4a41-5fdc-8aa4-7a083a4a2d54",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Systems: Data Universal Numbering System (DUNS), DUNS number\n- Companies: Dun & Bradstreet (D&B)\n- Concepts: business identifiers, business records\n\nFacts:\n- The Data Universal Numbering System, abbreviated as DUNS or D-U-N-S, is a proprietary system developed and regulated by Dun & Bradstreet (D&B).\n- The Data Universal Numbering System assigns a unique numeric identifier, called a DUNS number, to a single business entity.\n- Dun & Bradstreet, often referred to as D&B, maintains a database containing more than 265 million business records worldwide.",
